# Assembled package (see build.sh) and this crate's own build/lock state. It
# is a separate workspace (see ../../Cargo.toml), so it carries its own lock
# file. `dist/` is generated wholesale — the sources are js/ and
# package.template.json.
/dist/
/pkg/
/target/
/Cargo.lock
# Both supplied locally by whoever runs the demo; see www/index.html.
# The document is generated — `cargo run --example document_save
# --features document-write` writes examples/document.hplot, which is
# itself gitignored.
/www/font.ttf
/www/document.hplot
